  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a Green Logistics Module for Vocational Training in support of green transition in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to develop a Green Logistics Module for VET to support VET institutions across the country to deliver green skills training in logistics and related courses, improving the workforce&#x2019;s readiness for implementing the green transition in Vietnam. The project will also advocate for the Department of Vocational and Continuing Education and Training (DVCET), Ministry of Education and Training (MOET) to review and update the learning outcome standards for logistics training programs and other programs to ensure green skills are sufficiently included in VET curriculum in all industries. The Module is also expected to support organizations, businesses, or individuals in training or exploring green skills in logistics.</narrative>
  </description>
